    is equipped in the Skin tab."
set key[id=11701503] tooltipDescription "<font color='#ff8ae5' size='14'>[Mystic Enchant]\\nEnchanting increases \
    the 'Max Weapon Attack' option.</font>"
set key[id=11701503] guideDescription "\\n<font color='#7A7A7A'>Anti-magic equipment made to be used inside the \
    dark rift in space and time. The anti-magic particles in the equipment absorb the dark energy of the rift in \
    reverse, stabilize it, convert it into light energy, and pass it on to the weapon.</font>"
